ganv(){return"After joining or creating a workspace, a member sees one compact card on the Reserve hub: which workspace they are in, and one suggested next step \u2014 choose a time to book, view their membership, or open the help \u2014 only where the features and their permissions allow it. Not now hides it; Settings can show it again. It never books, pays or approves anything. For whoever configures the space, the settings also show how far it is from a first booking, section by section. Off hides the card and that checklist and changes nothing else."},
