ganA(){return"How each member got here"},
ganB(){return"One page per member: photo and presence, when they were last seen, what they have booked and what comes next, quick actions to message, WhatsApp or e-mail them, contact and money cards, and for admins every setting grouped by topic with its current value. Off: the profile sheet and the Members & plans action sheet."},
